WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.969 --> 00:00:05.899
Hey youtubers it’s Charlie and yesterday
in my Walking Dead US Video I asked you to

00:00:05.899 --> 00:00:10.240
submit all your questions about the finale,
Terminus, Beth and everything else.

00:00:10.240 --> 00:00:14.360
I picked 10 of them to answer in this video
and one bonus question.

00:00:14.360 --> 00:00:18.099
Generally we’re all wondering if Barbecue
Beth is going to be on the menu and who else

00:00:18.099 --> 00:00:19.099
is going to die.

00:00:19.099 --> 00:00:20.099
First thing’s first though.

00:00:20.099 --> 00:00:22.119
Congratulations to Chloe Fynn, you’re the
winner of this week’s giveaway.

00:00:22.119 --> 00:00:25.340
I’ll be ‘DMing you on your channel for
details.

00:00:25.340 --> 00:00:30.740
Next week I’ll be giving away two gift cards.

00:00:30.740 --> 00:00:33.950
I’ll also be doing more season 5 predictions
videos this week.

00:00:33.950 --> 00:00:37.510
So be sure to subscribe to get everything
if you’re finding me for the first time.

00:00:37.510 --> 00:00:39.010
So let’s answer some questions.

00:00:39.010 --> 00:00:43.710
Careful for spoilers from episode 15 and everything
in the comics up to The Hunters if you’re

00:00:43.710 --> 00:00:44.710
not caught up.

00:00:44.710 --> 00:00:45.760
Here we go,

00:00:45.760 --> 00:00:51.960
Question 1 - Guardians 3000 asks What did
Glenn and Tara use to lure the walkers to

00:00:51.960 --> 00:00:53.320
the one side of the tunnel?

00:00:53.320 --> 00:00:56.900
They just used the Flash light to cast a shadow
on the wall.

00:00:56.900 --> 00:01:01.120
It was hard to see, but the Wallkers were
attracted to the bright light and the motion.

00:01:01.120 --> 00:01:05.579
Which explains why in episode 9 when Michonne
had her Walker pets, and was walking in that

00:01:05.579 --> 00:01:07.470
big group of them, they didn’t turn on her.

00:01:07.470 --> 00:01:11.380
So, if the virus ever breaks out be sure to
take these notes down.

00:01:11.380 --> 00:01:16.060
Walk slowly simulating the movements of any
Walkers around you, and they may not notice

00:01:16.060 --> 00:01:17.060
you.

00:01:17.060 --> 00:01:18.570
No Guarantees.

00:01:18.570 --> 00:01:22.680
Question 2 - Gabby Chestnut asks Do you think
that Maggie and Glenn burning her picture

00:01:22.680 --> 00:01:24.050
is foreshadowing?﻿

00:01:24.050 --> 00:01:25.650
Yes, absolutely.

00:01:25.650 --> 00:01:29.630
Maggie has been one of the people I think
is most likely to die in the finale.

00:01:29.630 --> 00:01:33.530
I already mentioned how romance is a death
sentence on the show.

00:01:33.530 --> 00:01:36.610
But she is not a clear thinker, nor is Glenn.

00:01:36.610 --> 00:01:39.790
That impulsiveness is probably going to get
her into trouble in the finale.

00:01:39.790 --> 00:01:43.030
We don’t know whether the people who took
Beth are hostile or not.

00:01:43.030 --> 00:01:48.220
Everyone is getting Hunter vibes, but they
could just as easily be non-cannibal villains.

00:01:48.220 --> 00:01:52.670
Question 3 - Macsization asks Why are Rick's
hands covered in blood in the teaser for the

00:01:52.670 --> 00:01:53.670
next episode?

00:01:53.670 --> 00:01:58.189
That’s probably just a follow up on the
visual teaser of Tony looking at that Candy

00:01:58.189 --> 00:01:59.880
Wrapper on the railroad tracks.

00:01:59.880 --> 00:02:02.600
Rick will at the very least, end up in a fight
with Joe’s group.

00:02:02.600 --> 00:02:06.190
Then there’s still the wild card of the
people at Terminus.

00:02:06.190 --> 00:02:09.899
There wasn’t anyone at the gate, but there
was a sign that said lay down your weapons

00:02:09.899 --> 00:02:11.870
or you’ll be met by force.

00:02:11.870 --> 00:02:14.120
So there have to be more people there somewhere.

00:02:14.120 --> 00:02:17.260
Rick looked like most of his Governor beating
had healed.

00:02:17.260 --> 00:02:20.990
But he’s still squishy, so while I think
he’ll have to fight Joe’s men.

00:02:20.990 --> 00:02:24.300
I don’t think it will be as brutal as his
brawl with the Governor.

00:02:24.300 --> 00:02:28.040
And there’s the added bonus of having Daryl
to help him.

00:02:28.040 --> 00:02:32.040
Question 4 - Dominique Lionsdale asks do you
think we’ll learn what happened to Beth

00:02:32.040 --> 00:02:33.040
in the finale?

00:02:33.040 --> 00:02:39.739
Yes, I saw a lot of you guys commenting on
whether or not they’d show her in the finale.

00:02:39.739 --> 00:02:41.880
We haven’t gotten any answers since she
was kidnapped.

00:02:41.880 --> 00:02:46.470
And there’s a laundry list of people that
could have taken her, from bandits, to Gareth

00:02:46.470 --> 00:02:47.580
to Hunters.

00:02:47.580 --> 00:02:50.970
I feel like if they had already revealed what
happened to her before the finale.

00:02:50.970 --> 00:02:53.080
Things would be half as stressful.

00:02:53.080 --> 00:02:55.400
Which is a good thing, from the writer’s
standpoint.

00:02:55.400 --> 00:02:59.680
I don’t know about you guys, but I will
go crazy if I don’t find out if she’s

00:02:59.680 --> 00:03:00.680
okay.

00:03:00.680 --> 00:03:05.080
So I’m forced to watch next week.

00:03:05.080 --> 00:03:07.680
Not that I wouldn’t watch if everything
were reversed.

00:03:07.680 --> 00:03:13.190
Even if the finale weren’t as good as last
year it would still be a lot of fun.

00:03:13.190 --> 00:03:17.830
That being said, the candelight vigil for
Beth starts Saturday night.

00:03:17.830 --> 00:03:22.760
Question 5 - PickAHand asks What the hell
Maggie?﻿ Why hasn’t she expressed more

00:03:22.760 --> 00:03:24.569
concern about Beth?

00:03:24.569 --> 00:03:30.489
I also have seen a disturbing lack of concern
over Beth from everyone except Daryl.

00:03:30.489 --> 00:03:33.940
I think there’s a couple of reasons Maggie
hasn’t said anything about it yet.

00:03:33.940 --> 00:03:37.770
First, she probably felt like Beth was in
good company when they parted ways at the

00:03:37.770 --> 00:03:38.770
prison.

00:03:38.770 --> 00:03:41.910
Two, she was forcibly separated from Glenn.

00:03:41.910 --> 00:03:45.129
So she had no idea what he was doing when
they got split up.

00:03:45.129 --> 00:03:47.440
She knew Beth got on the bus and got away.

00:03:47.440 --> 00:03:52.730
She’s also probably thinking about Beth,
and just not saying anything out loud.

00:03:52.730 --> 00:03:55.440
It’s not like she’s had a ton of lines
this half of the season.

00:03:55.440 --> 00:03:59.200
And lastly, they could be building her character
up for a big reveal.

00:03:59.200 --> 00:04:04.050
For instance, we’ve established Maggie is
a little crazy.

00:04:04.050 --> 00:04:08.410
What if something bad happened to Beth and
Maggie reacts violently.

00:04:08.410 --> 00:04:12.910
If she’s the one that’s going to die,
Beth could be the macguffin that leads to

00:04:12.910 --> 00:04:13.910
that.

00:04:13.910 --> 00:04:18.380
Question 6 - Manuel Cortez asks Do you think
that Daryl will find out Joe’s group is

00:04:18.380 --> 00:04:20.660
hunting for Rick before they find him?

00:04:20.660 --> 00:04:24.150
No, I think he’ll be totally surprised.

00:04:24.150 --> 00:04:26.270
It makes for a better oh shit reaction.

00:04:26.270 --> 00:04:29.630
Because he’d be stunned that his friend
is still alive and at the same time Tony will

00:04:29.630 --> 00:04:32.270
be trying to “claim him” with his assault
rifle.

00:04:32.270 --> 00:04:35.210
Remember how that other redneck stole Daryl’s
rabbit kill.

00:04:35.210 --> 00:04:37.680
He shot first and asked questions later.

00:04:37.680 --> 00:04:41.750
Something tells me the rest of those guys
are just like that.

00:04:41.750 --> 00:04:46.090
And Daryl will be forced to choose between
the outdoor cats and the indoor cats while

00:04:46.090 --> 00:04:47.750
all that is happening.

00:04:47.750 --> 00:04:51.460
Let it be said though, does anyone think for
a minute that Daryl wouldn’t choose his

00:04:51.460 --> 00:04:52.949
friends over the marauders?

00:04:52.949 --> 00:04:56.310
It really depends on what happened to Beth.

00:04:56.310 --> 00:05:04.720
If she’s still alive, she’ll swing him
in the right direction.

00:05:04.720 --> 00:05:11.520
Question 7 - Josh Redgrave asks When the show
ends for ever how would you like it to end?﻿

00:05:11.520 --> 00:05:16.150
So all the time people are leaving, because
the die and people are coming.

00:05:16.150 --> 00:05:17.150
Like Abraha, Eugene and Rosita.

00:05:17.150 --> 00:05:21.820
I think the show should end when the last
of the original cast is alone.

00:05:21.820 --> 00:05:26.530
Everyone else from season 1 is dead and this
last person has to re-form a new group somewhere.

00:05:26.530 --> 00:05:30.740
They’ve never hinted that there might actually
be a cure, a real cure.

00:05:30.740 --> 00:05:35.600
So by that logic, humanity will just slowly
converge and either die off or just hold their

00:05:35.600 --> 00:05:37.170
ground indefinitely.

00:05:37.170 --> 00:05:41.120
The numbers aren’t promising, so everyone
on the planet will probably be dead inside

00:05:41.120 --> 00:05:44.630
of 50 years unless they cure the virus.

00:05:44.630 --> 00:05:47.830
I think it ending in a really depressing,
this is just the way it’s going to be moment

00:05:47.830 --> 00:05:49.530
would be appropriate.

00:05:49.530 --> 00:05:54.270
Something that would let you know that even
though that one last character is alive with

00:05:54.270 --> 00:05:55.790
other new people.

00:05:55.790 --> 00:05:59.480
Humanity in general is doomed in the long
run.

00:05:59.480 --> 00:06:03.680
Walking Dead is a show of attrition, for everyone
one new person that comes one, it seems like

00:06:03.680 --> 00:06:05.210
two people die.

00:06:05.210 --> 00:06:11.470
Question 8 - I’m the Donut asks Do you think
that Morgan will be involved in the finale?

00:06:11.470 --> 00:06:14.169
I think it’s still too soon for him to come
back.

00:06:14.169 --> 00:06:17.460
Scott Gimple said he would re appear, but
not this season.

00:06:17.460 --> 00:06:19.330
So next year or later.

00:06:19.330 --> 00:06:22.410
But he’ll definitely come back at some point.

00:06:22.410 --> 00:06:25.830
I think Gareth is the real character behind
Terminus.

00:06:25.830 --> 00:06:26.830
For better or worse.

00:06:26.830 --> 00:06:28.809
We still don’t know if he’s a villain.

00:06:28.809 --> 00:06:34.300
Question 9 - joe kerr asks K Do you think
the painting that Carl found was a painting

00:06:34.300 --> 00:06:39.680
of Mary?﻿

00:06:39.680 --> 00:06:41.420
Someone on reddit actually connected the dots.

00:06:41.420 --> 00:06:45.710
But yes, the person in the painting looks
exactly like Mary.

00:06:45.710 --> 00:06:49.300
Which means that was probably her family in
the pink room.

00:06:49.300 --> 00:06:54.139
It lends credence to the fact she’s a little
crazy and we just won’t find out till it’s

00:06:54.139 --> 00:06:55.139
too late.

00:06:55.139 --> 00:06:59.220
Hopefully that mystery meat she’s serving
up isn’t what we think it is.

00:06:59.220 --> 00:07:05.960
Question 10 - Maddie Hall asks Do you think
they are eating Beth?

00:07:05.960 --> 00:07:08.520
So this could go down a number of ways.

00:07:08.520 --> 00:07:13.520
If they are hunters, and they’re paying
homage to the comics, then they wouldn’t

00:07:13.520 --> 00:07:16.840
be eating Beth, they’d just be eating her
leg.

00:07:16.840 --> 00:07:20.550
In the comics it was Dale, who had been bitten
by a walker when that happened.

00:07:20.550 --> 00:07:21.920
And Beth was just kidnapped.

00:07:21.920 --> 00:07:23.310
She didn’t get bitten.

00:07:23.310 --> 00:07:27.069
So no matter what, they’d have to change
a few things about that part of the story.

00:07:27.069 --> 00:07:29.130
I really hope they’re not hunters.

00:07:29.130 --> 00:07:32.620
Or if they are Hunters, they just have her
tied up somewhere.

00:07:32.620 --> 00:07:35.860
With all her limbs firmly attached.

00:07:35.860 --> 00:07:40.260
Bonus Question - Laurent asks Why do you think
the doors of the terminus and the whole thing

00:07:40.260 --> 00:07:42.410
wasn't really secured?

00:07:42.410 --> 00:07:43.410
﻿

00:07:43.410 --> 00:07:45.950
I think they have people ready with weapons
in case something goes wrong.

00:07:45.950 --> 00:07:49.870
And it’s in a nice open area, so you’d
be able to see Walkers approaching from a

00:07:49.870 --> 00:07:51.670
long way away.

00:07:51.670 --> 00:07:55.020
That sign said lay down your weapons or you’ll
be met by force.

00:07:55.020 --> 00:07:57.660
It think next week we’ll meet the force.

00:07:57.660 --> 00:08:01.970
So thanks so much for submitting questions,
next Sunday it all goes down.

00:08:01.970 --> 00:08:07.650
I’ll be doing a season 5 predictions video
sometime this week, be sure to subscribe to

00:08:07.650 --> 00:08:08.650
get it.

00:08:08.650 --> 00:08:12.419
And now that Walking Dead is almost over,
let me know what kind of videos you want to

00:08:12.419 --> 00:08:15.280
see me do for it until it comes back.

00:08:15.280 --> 00:08:17.300
Like the Game of Thrones videos I do, or something
else.

00:08:17.300 --> 00:08:18.400
Be sure to let me know.

00:08:18.400 --> 00:08:23.870
Right now click here for my review of the
episode and click here for my Lizzie WTF video.

00:08:23.870 --> 00:08:26.690
That will be a good episode to re-visit in
the off season.

00:08:26.690 --> 00:08:29.000
Thanks for watching, see you guys tomorrow,
high fives!

